[[32,127,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237980\">2127C56</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) and (1b) from the even\nand odd gear engagement solenoids.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Solenoid 1 (gear engagement)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236760\">L51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Solenoid 2 (gear engagement)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236764\">L52</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the even and odd gear engagement\nsolenoid valves (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069828.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[32,127,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the even and uneven gear engagement\nsolenoid valves back in their housings and secure them using the\nbolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections of the\neven and odd gear engagement solenoids.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237980\">2127C56</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <strong>- 0010T47 hydraulic system fluid\nfor gearbox with hydraulic selection check level and top up if necessary</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <strong>- 0010T48 hydraulic system for gearbox\nwith hydraulic selection bleed air</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]